    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec02ea772a44e4b7a0d512d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふあぁ～…。\r\n深夜の通販番組ってさー、\r\nたまーにツボついてくるよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9543412997d42fe96f181fa3743e20e80cf23e649d1e48c8802b3dae170a2466",
