      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f7565576f128cf6b512187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝のニュース見た～？\r\nまだならトピックス送るよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce59021366519444395fea17b64b0fc791be199dad3582c76ff6b1b153c6963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:455a6b384998930c988906e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて、お昼に仕入れた\r\n情報を精査しますか～。\r\n鮮度が命、ってね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff99c192fd817880d563572827027dbdd98ce4c3fc2433b437dc045e406e361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb8a34db7e89aef8fc38e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よーよー、トレちゃんよー。お昼は\r\nウチの見っけた隠れ家パン屋さんで\r\nど？ウケるメニューが多くてさぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "827d5cab446dda44a4e970b48ac58e3602ea711fa2e08ba2ea85b28e6445f620",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d834f0a5807490fd12be24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『深夜の校舎裏にUFO発見！』\r\n…行きたい。けど門限が――\r\nトレちゃん、なんとかならない？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5229c63365b0f5e78037ca1085b87b86473e35c3dfa2ad73bc73d06cdad3da7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383ab07f7c2f893c1f0f9d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今からだと、朝までコースか…。\r\nねーねー、動画編集のアシ、\r\nはちみーLでどう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "962beebfb82fb6044711e98280e07d1625a8241a65164be71f511fcbd5c84e46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3921b95e96640710a3c0268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お花見のマル秘スポット？\r\n知ってる知ってる。\r\nんじゃー代金は桜餅でよろ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93d428ba49ac166163c0bd9059798912eee1477ef06895c95294fae77a509a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c46bb464601292b0498bd53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏と言えば怪談！\r\nヒエッヒエになれるネタ、\r\nた～くさん仕入れてあるよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1131f5c30bf06460f61927b5604940c7d25b56658b95079e0e1eafa10c1ad5e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4a6e6e5b0ab67f0bdfd3198",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紅葉撮り行かな～い？\r\nトイカメラでどっちがエモく\r\nできるか、勝負しよ～ぜい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef30438cfd1c13f276a9a1e10244745f425862ed8c7eef1c135b4f6a7dd5ebe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ca0f2b0ce3bde6e474b951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "う～～、さぶっ！\r\nゾクゾクは求めてるけど、\r\nこういうんじゃないんだよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85ee5266553c30a3ee86a844d1744d357a8c36eed5ff1580db8b6a4344d7ab30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cebcce74c44d5145ba4d52a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘイヘイ、バレンタイ～ン♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b9de32e8e847af3aa3b85f95f9bd1e6342e6b6008d522ff78dc186cc79374e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5944804d49e6c06ccdb8602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フリオ、地元の話してると\r\nすんごいかわいい顔すんの。\r\nあの笑顔、ずるいよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff08cdda5b26b32b49b6f8bd1d4b53cfd8c42eb359c05cdf0396985071371af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7463ea35858d5b3efd84ccec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わ、フォロワー爆増してる。\r\n…コラボ効果、エグいな～。\r\nさっすがカレン。カリスマだわぁ",
      "source_fingerprint": "d01b1e319806bc37779dcf305314aa82ca7affcef3d4fd546627add01466dc32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf2f920db26e25daf77c96c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エスポんにあ～んしても、\r\n絶対拒否られんだよね。\r\n次は不意打ち試そ～っと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8e27983099a69cd5bf214ba8a0e428120b09116fa03a0dabe5ec0cacaa9763",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56ed0d5af3c9c41cabe7f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふっふっふ。最強の静電気防止\r\nインナーをゲットしたよん。\r\nどっからでもかかってこ～い…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceae8200d26add7d66196a7e4e8a38e380d1fa131d5dbc41821683e35b118a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c2cb8ec8b69294a25cf6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とーさんたちの撮影現場って、\r\nガチだからゾクっとすんだよね。\r\nそりゃいい画を撮るわけだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78073eac895b14d071a63635c51ea32267ff2a031c17ebacdb71d4c7af0ebaaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ea9b418970dbdd9685d6d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスのコツ聞かれてさ、情報\r\n渡すつもりが踊ってみせるハメに…\r\nごっつかわいい系の振り、疲れた～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b837fa74f863de6dee1ccdfb956e8fc7a0dfebbcf4832db59b24ff4913da9f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce135290bb00bbf708693866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ね、この衣装さー、\r\n冷却ファン内蔵させない？\r\nライブ中もきっと涼しいよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb10499339a247d1db44f3dc2346703cd4ca67e0e7e2c34e5128de499e28b46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8413fd67be981387182f61d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "攻め攻めでいいっしょ？\r\nレースもガンガン行こう、\r\nって気になれるんだよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cecac6c334b9b7e481c85caa510a9bfed8997d727cb8bf0498c210db9e6ea2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e36f4b00b8fc7fd61efae8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このポーチは亜空間に繋がってて、\r\n情報屋アイテムが飛び出すのさ。\r\n…あはっ、信じた？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbba41ddd023a26803df44450beac798583bf4284f4672a31c956e1bd2acd26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0412d88a3a198a37eef7f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなが朝トレに何してるか、\r\nちゃ～んとチェックしといたよん。\r\nふっふっふ、できるっしょ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a536f1116ad4ae49e0cfa4e4df01b4508ba748b15e3e7d6ad0c27e260656df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b786e47e5925f36ddf9f57f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "購買の新作ゲット～。\r\nね、これからおやつタイムとか\r\nどーよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffe7f114b6206343edb9e597a30ccad610a5c6151f8c9a643be2c89cee633872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b4ee2acd013f0ad923dfea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キミの走り、ぜ～んぶ\r\n暴かせてもらうよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca4d1e01d2a488cb2b58db4308384671acbb693583d78bcb05a5eefe9d20c88e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b0f406b4dd68f1ef14fc28e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そろそろ情報屋は閉店だね。\r\n寝る前にアキュートちゃんの\r\n生姜湯いただこ～っと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57244d23fca28e49cd281678998ab2a3855d689942982bfa07e55f0956d3ab72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97db4e1c4df42c7872dac02e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気になるニューフェイスはいた？\r\n来歴、特徴、将来の目標――\r\nぜーんぶ揃ってるよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96db7b8bc9c6b6f18336948251459f6eed56ab1a765584f16acb4cac1823b67c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3d6fc5777ad88bcc49671a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハンディファン買うなら、\r\nなんでも聞いてよん。\r\nこれまで20個以上試したからさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e23ad9fe2b5d25e383e49027a2d87cd734056a1025bae6baf189a628df4368e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:354a7406fb6a3df85d38876c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょいちょい、耳貸して。\r\n…数量限定の激うま焼き芋屋\r\n見つけた…これ、しーっのやつね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "229fa3078e4cb3926dac96bc93f0b163f6d5275e56bba6d4d53c85f7126ca3d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e85147ade9269cd7a1f789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんながオフシーズンにしてる\r\n準備、まとめて持ってきたよん。\r\nさ～、研究タイムといきますか～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d740546499c6efedbbaad716bc66e1e259086005d6f103ea8453027c510c4467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82c32231a8aeb2ec3efbfd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これまでのトレーニング情報、\r\nがっつりまとめといたよん。\r\nトレちゃんなら活用できるでしょ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ff67ed20097f68d978c08b73e2a6a7f9d5cb7ec3540e8d2a5387d6c0055663",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6841d9f6ea0b512ea582f1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行きますか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca6e7ee0e337e51b6520d09ac6b67f9a3e4b25e3711c8ab015c6b39cf89079e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb27bf0dd4b50f49d04a167",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腹筋強化ベルト、バズってるよね～\r\nウチも買ったけどよさげだよん。\r\nトレーニングに、ど？",
      "source_fingerprint": "df96c985ccc3abccfef58e9180074956ca68c4f81eb02df7ec1277176105deb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f2635b10108edd22c31c6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "め～っちゃ映画の話したいけど…\r\nうん、ちょいガマンする。\r\n先にやることやらないとね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb187afb75b775a4b59a26649699fb444c5fa2d5b53be79682ca3b635c4e8ec2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9baeeeaf06c9775a0fe583",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "併走組むなら強い子でよろー。\r\nトレーニングでも\r\nゾクゾクしたいじゃん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d88df9014e876fd7b47ed6a424b15c8d33ef90aaf75400ce1e75095818bd46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7661371a591e4b9e092500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カバンからスポドリ取ってくれる？\r\n別に中身見てもいいよん。\r\nウチらの仲だし、今さらじゃ～ん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "274fcdb639828831f87de937dc6e316727880b087032c60ac7feec71f6ba1b4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea8781771fb47516a51fdec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あは。トレちゃんってば、ウチから\r\n目が離せない感じ？そんじゃ、\r\nもっとワクワクさせちゃいますか～",
      "source_fingerprint": "af1d307648124584671e81a524609c23b0b619c41809b7bc7e5693ff02eebe55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
